      "artist": "UN  International Criminal Tribunal for the former Yugoslavia",
      "description": "Over the last 23 years, thousands of visitors to the ICTY have attended public hearings. At its peak, the Tribunal had three courtrooms and up to 7 trials were held on a day. The trials were held in either the morning session or the afternoon session so two trials a days could be held in each courtroom.",
